{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Land</strong> is a relaxing building game about turning a barren landscape into a thriving ecosystem. Collect resources, restore the land, and create a safe habitat where life can flourish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing but dry soil and scattered debris. Gather <strong>solar energy</strong>, <strong>water</strong>, and <strong>trash</strong>\u00a0and start building to begin transforming the environment into fertile ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Habitat</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/8084f020c805ecf761938012564ff7cf.poster.avif?t=1761823870\" width=900 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/8084f020c805ecf761938012564ff7cf.webm?t=1761823870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/8084f020c805ecf761938012564ff7cf.mp4?t=1761823870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place modules and plants to clean, recycle, and transform the land. Watch new life take root.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Attract Wildlife</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/2b093782f0e13c0c718059d69e9a985f.poster.avif?t=1761823870\" width=804 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/2b093782f0e13c0c718059d69e9a985f.webm?t=1761823870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/2b093782f0e13c0c718059d69e9a985f.mp4?t=1761823870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ecosystem grows, animals return. Each species thrives under different conditions: find the balance that sustains them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/a717169ac01785086bb37b8b7261df1c.poster.avif?t=1761823870\" width=748 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/a717169ac01785086bb37b8b7261df1c.webm?t=1761823870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/a717169ac01785086bb37b8b7261df1c.mp4?t=1761823870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gather resources to unlock upgrades and expand your self-sustaining world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132310?t=1761823870","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132310?t=1761823870","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/f68ddc43fedbcdde2aac2381643c36aa90bd6acd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761823870","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/f68ddc43fedbcdde2aac2381643c36aa90bd6acd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761823870","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Land</str